I don't know the details of MacOS, but is it possible that ? is a wildcard
in the same fashion as ? and * on MSDOS and *nix?  Attempting to create or
otherwise directly access any file with a wildcard in its name will cause
a file creation error on such systems.  This could be your problem.

I suppose a fix in terms of Nethack code would be to disallow anything but
alphanumerics, - and ' in character names...?

